.TH HERDSMAN-SPEC 1 "" "herdsman" "herdsman manual"
.SH NAME
herdsman-spec \- Print the SDK contracts: spec cli|proto|descriptor.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
usage: herdsman spec cli|proto|descriptor

cli prints every command, flag and exit code as JSON.
proto prints every contract source, each after a "// file: <path>" line.
descriptor prints the contracts' serialized FileDescriptorSet, with every
import before the file that needs it.

exit codes:
  0  the contracts were printed
  1  the contracts could not be read or written
  2  usage error
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR herdsman (1)
